1
00:00:00,294 --> 00:00:02,584
(Raj:)I really don't get your problem
with birds.

2
00:00:02,754 --> 00:00:07,174
(Sheldon:)The question you should be asking is,
what is their problem with me?

3
00:00:07,342 --> 00:00:11,432
(Sheldon:)My first memory, a hummingbird
dive-bombing my stroller...

4
00:00:11,597 --> 00:00:14,637
(Sheldon:)...to get at the apple juice
in my sippy cup.

5
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:16,730
(Raj:)Hummingbirds are pretty.

6
00:00:16,894 --> 00:00:20,434
(Sheldon:)Hummingbirds are the vampires
of the flower world.

7
00:00:22,232 --> 00:00:24,942
(Raj:)Still my first choice
for an ankle tattoo.

8
00:00:26,737 --> 00:00:30,077
(Raj:)Or a dolphin. I go back and forth.

9
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:33,580
Age 7, a blood-thirsty chicken
chases me up a tree.

10
00:00:33,744 --> 00:00:38,834
Age 12, a magpie tries to steal
the retainer out of my mouth.

11
00:00:38,999 --> 00:00:43,089
Age 16, a parrot in a pet store
calls me fat ass.

12
00:00:44,588 --> 00:00:45,878
(Sheldon:)Need I go on?

13
00:00:46,048 --> 00:00:48,888
(Raj:)Yes, please.
This is way better than the movie, heh.

14
00:00:49,051 --> 00:00:52,011
(Howard:)All right, Sheldon.
Your bird death ray is ready.

15
00:00:52,179 --> 00:00:56,479
(Sheldon:)It's not a death ray. It's just a little
uItrasonic blast to scare him off.

16
00:00:56,642 --> 00:00:59,522
(Sheldon:)Trust me, if I had a death ray,
I wouldn't be Iiving here.

